# The mid-rise blocks platted.toml raises at 40,000 Citizens, from above, over the Tower cluster's
# neighbourhood. The band reaches far enough that every block in frame draws as a body.
2 pause
2 ui family-bodies on 2500
2 roads on
2 focus 578 572 520
2 tilt 45
2 shoot artifacts/midrise-families/drive/midrise-aerial.png
2 draw artifacts/midrise-families/drive/midrise-aerial.tsv
2 quit
